{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112466","id":2984420215,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6x4qN3","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112466","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112466.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112466.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112466","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112466/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112466/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112466/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f7455c1df8e3b8c5caf5984d60f3aaa02b66de8b","number":112466,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix `OS.get_cmdline_args` documentation","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\nThe current documentation for `OS.get_cmdline_args()` implies that *all* passed arguments are returned, but only those that were not processed by the engine are actually returned. This means that e.g. `--fullscreen` will never appear in the returned array, as well as many other arguments.\r\n\r\nThis PR clarifies this point, and fixes the example in `OS.get_cmdline_user_args()`, since the returned values are different from the actual behavior.\r\n\r\nIt's unfortunately not possible to get the full command that was passed to the engine, before some arguments get processed.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/fo